<title>JAPAN: Zexel -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Zexel -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		126.11		vs	  132.50</p>
<p> Operating	    5.80		vs	    5.03</p>
<p> Current		4.04		vs	    4.14</p>
<p> Net		    2.06		vs	    2.68</p>
<p> EPS		    8.37 yen	  vs	   10.89 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    246 million	  vs	 246 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Zexel Corp is a maker of fuel injection pumps for diesel engines.</p>
